  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the notification for the post of Principal. This recruitment has been issued for 111 posts. The online application process for UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment 2026 has started on 21 July 2026, and candidates can apply till 20 August 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Education Service Selection Commission (UPESSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPESSC Advt. No. : 02/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>21 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>20 August 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>20 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction Last Date : <strong>23 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>24 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC :<strong> Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPESSC UP Principal Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 October 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>62 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPESSC UP Principal 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 111 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.9322%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50.9322%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">UP Principal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 24.602%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.4657%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having Ph.D Degree from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">15 Year Experience.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPESSC UP Principal Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://upessc.up.gov.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the UPESSC before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for UPESSC UP Principal recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे ।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UPESSC UP Principal Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Written Exam</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview (Viva-Voce)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adin