e official download link of the result will be made available in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is UPESSC Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of UPESSC is https://upessc.up.gov.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
